Hubris brought us here. Ula''tek specimens broke free from their cages. They quickly overpowered their handlers and overran the peninsula. Worse, a commander has appeared and he''s feeding off of energy stored here. 

And he''s shielded while he does it.

The only way to rid the Ula''tek from this place is to use the energy against them. Reconfigure the Energy Distributors. Doing so will free the monsters but will also stun them. It''ll give you an opening.

All those realigned distributors together will knock out the commander''s shield. 

He''ll then be exposed.', '', 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `ID`=VALUES(`ID`), `Text`=VALUES(`Text`), `Text1`=VALUES(`Text1`), `LanguageID`=VALUES(`LanguageID`), `ConditionID`=VALUES(`ConditionID`), `EmotesID`=VALUES(`EmotesID`), `Flags`=VALUES(`Flags`), `ChatBubbleDurationMs`=VALUES(`ChatBubbleDurationMs`), `VoiceOverPriorityID`=VALUES(`VoiceOverPriorityID`), `SoundKitID1`=VALUES(`SoundKitID1`), `SoundKitID2`=VALUES(`SoundKitID2`), `EmoteID1`=VALUES(`EmoteID1`), `EmoteID2`=VALUES(`EmoteID2`), `EmoteID3`=VALUES(`EmoteID3`), `EmoteDelay1`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay1`), `EmoteDelay2`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay2`), `EmoteDelay3`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay3`);
