You are charged with the mission of establishing a manaforge grid on the world designated as "Naigtal."

The oceans of this world show high levels of arcane energy, which appears to have impacted biomes across the planet.

Preliminary mana cell drops will be deployed to the world on our next shipment from the Sodaraam Sector.

Operation Arcocean Spark is now underway.

--Authorotum Dispatch Consul', '', 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `ID`=VALUES(`ID`), `Text`=VALUES(`Text`), `Text1`=VALUES(`Text1`), `LanguageID`=VALUES(`LanguageID`), `ConditionID`=VALUES(`ConditionID`), `EmotesID`=VALUES(`EmotesID`), `Flags`=VALUES(`Flags`), `ChatBubbleDurationMs`=VALUES(`ChatBubbleDurationMs`), `VoiceOverPriorityID`=VALUES(`VoiceOverPriorityID`), `SoundKitID1`=VALUES(`SoundKitID1`), `SoundKitID2`=VALUES(`SoundKitID2`), `EmoteID1`=VALUES(`EmoteID1`), `EmoteID2`=VALUES(`EmoteID2`), `EmoteID3`=VALUES(`EmoteID3`), `EmoteDelay1`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay1`), `EmoteDelay2`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay2`), `EmoteDelay3`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay3`);
