This is the fourth holomissive I have sent and have not yet received a reply.

The Sodaraam mana cell delivery has yet to arrive and my forces are waiting on standby for deployment.

We cannot establish an entire manaforge grid, let alone a single pipeline, without preliminary mana supplies.

I urgently request a redirect of mana cells from other operational grids immediately.

Your most humble and patient servant,

Nexus-Captain Leth''ir', 'Dispatch Consul,

