Your recent actions are a flagrant display of insubordination and unprecedented foolishness.

Your unsanctioned hostile activities on Azeroth have exposed the Hal''hadar.

The Authorotum would have every reason to strip you of your rank and cast your unbound form into the nearest Heraazi sun.

Fortunately, I have managed to convince them to hold off.

Now that Naigtal''s manaforges are operational, you are ordered to disengage with Azeroth and cease hostilities.

--Arc-Chancellor Ahl''dynsir', '', 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `ID`=VALUES(`ID`), `Text`=VALUES(`Text`), `Text1`=VALUES(`Text1`), `LanguageID`=VALUES(`LanguageID`), `ConditionID`=VALUES(`ConditionID`), `EmotesID`=VALUES(`EmotesID`), `Flags`=VALUES(`Flags`), `ChatBubbleDurationMs`=VALUES(`ChatBubbleDurationMs`), `VoiceOverPriorityID`=VALUES(`VoiceOverPriorityID`), `SoundKitID1`=VALUES(`SoundKitID1`), `SoundKitID2`=VALUES(`SoundKitID2`), `EmoteID1`=VALUES(`EmoteID1`), `EmoteID2`=VALUES(`EmoteID2`), `EmoteID3`=VALUES(`EmoteID3`), `EmoteDelay1`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay1`), `EmoteDelay2`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay2`), `EmoteDelay3`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay3`);
