Normally, delving for ancient treasures is a me, myself, and I job. But... why''s it always gotta be snakes?

My research leads to this spot. I have it on good authority the final resting places of three priceless antiquities: the Ark of the Cobranant, the Snakara Stones, and even the Holy Scale... they''re all here!

How''re you around snakes? I''ve tip-toed around some before but these look different. Swollen and sick like they''re gonna burst!

If you can retrieve those treasures... well, it''s for more than money. It''s about keeping them out of the wrong hands. You follow, yeah?', '', 0, 0, 0, 256, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `ID`=VALUES(`ID`), `Text`=VALUES(`Text`), `Text1`=VALUES(`Text1`), `LanguageID`=VALUES(`LanguageID`), `ConditionID`=VALUES(`ConditionID`), `EmotesID`=VALUES(`EmotesID`), `Flags`=VALUES(`Flags`), `ChatBubbleDurationMs`=VALUES(`ChatBubbleDurationMs`), `VoiceOverPriorityID`=VALUES(`VoiceOverPriorityID`), `SoundKitID1`=VALUES(`SoundKitID1`), `SoundKitID2`=VALUES(`SoundKitID2`), `EmoteID1`=VALUES(`EmoteID1`), `EmoteID2`=VALUES(`EmoteID2`), `EmoteID3`=VALUES(`EmoteID3`), `EmoteDelay1`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay1`), `EmoteDelay2`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay2`), `EmoteDelay3`=VALUES(`EmoteDelay3`);
